n   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm piece of unremarkable skin and subcutaneous tissue  The specimen is  entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS   FROZEN SECTION  1   NIPPLE AREOLAR COMPLEX    FOCAL SEVERELY ATYPICAL DUCTAL PROLIFERATION RAISING CONCERN FOR DUCTAL  CARCINOMA IN SITU SEEN ON DEEPER LEVELS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2   RIGHT NIPPLE DUCTS    NO CARCINOMA IDENTIFIED  DEEPER LEVELS EXAMINED     Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M D   Electronically signed on  Friday REMOVED_MONTH 28   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 02 09 04PM  By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final  Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed  or corrected the diagnoses     PART A  Breast  Left   Nipple Areola Complex    Excision  PART B  Breast  Right   Nipple Ducts    Excision  PART C  Breast  Right   Mastectomy  PART D  Breast  Left   Mastectomy  PART E   Left Nipple   Excision  PART F  Skin  Left Breast   Excision  PART G  Skin  Right Breast   Excision  PART H  Cryostat Frozen Section  slid       report_end  , Other.
